      "body": "### \ud83d\udfe2 Approval recommended\n\nThe changes are test-only, align with the PR\u2019s stated intent (disable flakes while pinning counterexamples), and the new helpers/pins are internally consistent with existing test patterns.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull request overview</summary>\n\nThis PR stabilizes the `Evaluator.Properties` test suite by disabling two seed-flaky QCheck properties and replacing them with deterministic \u201cexpected failure\u201d pins based on known counterexamples, so CI remains reliable while the underlying evaluator/stepper bugs remain open.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Factor out a shared `QCheck_Util.show_core_exp` renderer to ensure counterexamples and Alcotest diffs don\u2019t hide semantic differences.\n- Replace the two flaky QCheck properties with skipped `test_case`s that still typecheck/compile for easy re-enabling.\n- Add deterministic unit tests that pin the current (known-wrong) behavior for #2128/#2372 and #2457, designed to go red when the bugs are fixed.\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>File summaries</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| test/QCheck_Util.re | Adds a shared `show_core_exp` printer for clearer counterexample/failure output and reuses it in generators. |\r\n| test/evaluator/Test_Evaluator_Properties.re | Disables two flaky QCheck properties, refactors shared check helpers, and adds deterministic \u201cknown bug\u201d pins for #2128/#2372 and #2457. |\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 2/2 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 0\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>\n\n---\n\n\ud83d\udca1 <a href=\"/hazelgrove/hazel/new/dev?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>",
